{"1674810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Into the Dangerous World I Leapt", "steam_appid": 1674810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674810/extras/f26cd56e4a58b858fe09db9d29963899.poster.avif?t=1633450665\" width=580 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674810/extras/f26cd56e4a58b858fe09db9d29963899.webm?t=1633450665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674810/extras/f26cd56e4a58b858fe09db9d29963899.mp4?t=1633450665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>You know him: he is near you: point him out:<br>Shall I see glories beaming from his brow?<br>Or trace his footsteps by the rising flowers?</i><br><br><strong>The year is 1801</strong> and the industrial revolution is in full swing. Cotton mills are being built all over England, with children providing the cheap workforce. You play as Idony, a small girl who just started working at one of these factories alongside her brother, Edus. One day you wake up and Edus is gone.<br><br>Into the Dangerous World I Leapt is a surreal first person puzzle game inspired by the works of William Blake. In it, you travel between two worlds, just like flipping a coin.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674810/extras/b42314b22db06f3f0ce2cb71b84435df.poster.avif?t=1633450665\" width=580 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674810/extras/b42314b22db06f3f0ce2cb71b84435df.webm?t=1633450665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674810/extras/b42314b22db06f3f0ce2cb71b84435df.mp4?t=1633450665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>1-2 hours of explorative gameplay.<br></li><li>Travel between two worlds and discover the secrets of The Factory.<br></li><li>Talk to angels, faces, and your fellow workers.<br></li><li>Solve puzzles and help the denizens of both worlds.<br></li><li>Pay the meat toll to enter the meat hall.<br></li><li>Stay away from The Beast.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674810/extras/bf4add59506702b85f969bacd382086e.poster.avif?t=1633450665\" width=580 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674810/extras/bf4add59506702b85f969bacd382086e.webm?t=1633450665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674810/extras/bf4add59506702b85f969bacd382086e.mp4?t=1633450665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>WASD</strong> - Move <br><strong>E</strong>         - Open Inventory<br><strong>Q</strong>         - Flip World <br><strong>LMB</strong>    - Interact<br><strong>RMB</strong>    - Throw/Return item to inventory <br><strong>SHIFT</strong>  - Sprint<br><strong>CTRL</strong>   - Crouch <br><strong>ESC  </strong>   - Pause/Skip Video <br><br><i>Developed as a 10 week end-of-term university project by a team of 12 students.</i>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674810/extras/f26cd56e4a58b858fe09db9d29963899.poster.avif?t=1633450665\" width=580 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674810/extras/f26cd56e4a58b858fe09db9d29963899.webm?t=1633450665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674810/extras/f26cd56e4a58b858fe09db9d29963899.mp4?t=1633450665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>You know him: he is near you: point him out:<br>Shall I see glories beaming from his brow?<br>Or trace his footsteps by the rising flowers?</i><br><br><strong>The year is 1801</strong> and the industrial revolution is in full swing. Cotton mills are being built all over England, with children providing the cheap workforce. You play as Idony, a small girl who just started working at one of these factories alongside her brother, Edus. One day you wake up and Edus is gone.<br><br>Into the Dangerous World I Leapt is a surreal first person puzzle game inspired by the works of William Blake. In it, you travel between two worlds, just like flipping a coin.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674810/extras/b42314b22db06f3f0ce2cb71b84435df.poster.avif?t=1633450665\" width=580 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674810/extras/b42314b22db06f3f0ce2cb71b84435df.webm?t=1633450665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674810/extras/b42314b22db06f3f0ce2cb71b84435df.mp4?t=1633450665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>1-2 hours of explorative gameplay.<br></li><li>Travel between two worlds and discover the secrets of The Factory.<br></li><li>Talk to angels, faces, and your fellow workers.<br></li><li>Solve puzzles and help the denizens of both worlds.<br></li><li>Pay the meat toll to enter the meat hall.<br></li><li>Stay away from The Beast.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674810/extras/b